  "description": "The OASIS MCP server connects Cursor, VS Code, Claude Desktop and other MCP clients to the hosted OASIS MCP endpoint (api.web6.oasisomniverse.one/mcp). All 508 typed WEB4–WEB10 commands execute in the hosted OASIS service as your avatar: each call is authorized against your OASIS JWT and metered through your WEB4 subscription. Configure OASIS_BEARER_TOKEN, or OASIS_USERNAME and OASIS_PASSWORD. Install with: dotnet tool install -g NextGenSoftware.OASIS.MCP.Server. The packaged MCP_TOOL_CATALOG.md lists every command.",
  "iconFile": "OASIS.jpg",
