  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "3.0.0 (breaking): the server is now a thin stdio proxy to the hosted OASIS MCP endpoint. Tools run server-side as your avatar, are authorized against your JWT (you can only act as yourself unless you are a Wizard), and are metered by your WEB4 subscription. Local OASIS_DNA, database and AI provider keys are no longer used. Configure OASIS_BEARER_TOKEN or OASIS_USERNAME/OASIS_PASSWORD; OASIS_MCP_URL overrides the endpoint.",
